# Mallet hardness and level from velocity: glock and marimba at velocities 1, 10, 20, 40, 64, 90, 110, 127 (soft is
# dark, slow to speak and quiet; hard is bright with a click).
tempo 120
steps 64
tail 2
track perc
preset 128 120 0 0 255 0 0 0 128 0 128 200 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 64 1 1
note 2 64 1 10
note 4 64 1 20
note 6 64 1 40
note 8 64 1 64
note 10 64 1 90
note 12 64 1 110
note 14 64 1 127
param p1 32 32
note 32 57 1 1
note 34 57 1 10
note 36 57 1 20
note 38 57 1 40
note 40 57 1 64
note 42 57 1 90
note 44 57 1 110
note 46 57 1 127
expect sound 0 64
expect peak_below 0
